{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "fleet-management-api-v2",
		"name": "Fleet Management API v2",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Fleet Management System with 50K+ vehicle support.\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:8080/api/v1`\n\n## API Versioning (Hybrid)\n- **URL Path**: `/api/v1/...` (primary)\n- **Header**: `X-API-Version: v1`\n- **Query**: `?api_version=v1`\n\n## Supported Versions\n- **v1**: Stable (current)\n- **v2**: Beta\n\n## Date & Time Formats (IMPORTANT)\n- **Date**: `DD-MM-YYYY` format ONLY (e.g., 31-12-2025, 01-01-2024)\n- **Time**: `HH:MM` 24-hour format (e.g., 14:30, 09:00)\n- **Note**: All date fields must use DD-MM-YYYY format. ISO 8601 format is NOT accepted for date fields.\n\n## Trip Response - State-Based Display Info\nTrip APIs return `display_info` object with state-appropriate fields:\n\n**Planned State**: estimated_distance, cargo_type, cost_summary. Distance/Duration = 'NA'\n**In Progress State**: covered_distance, duration, total_distance, cargo_type, cost_summary, progress_info\n**Completed State**: total_distance, duration, cargo_type, cost_summary\n\nKey fields: `display_value` (primary UI value), `display_label` (context label), values show 'NA' when unavailable.\n\n## Tech Stack\n- Go 1.21+ with Gin Framework\n- PostgreSQL 14+ with GORM\n- JWT Authentication\n- MQTT (EMQX) for GPS\n- WebSocket for real-time\n\n## User Roles\n- **Owner**: Full access\n- **Manager**: Operational access\n- **Supervisor**: View & track only\n\n## Rate Limits\n- Standard: 100 req/min\n- Location: 1000 req/min\n- Auth: 10 req/min",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "api_base",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "base_url_v2",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v2",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "vehicle_id",
			"value": "1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "driver_id",
			"value": "1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "trip_id",
			"value": "1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "date_format",
			"value": "DD-MM-YYYY",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "All dates must be in DD-MM-YYYY format (e.g., 31-12-2025)"
		},
		{
			"key": "time_format",
			"value": "HH:MM",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "All times must be in 24-hour HH:MM format (e.g., 14:30)"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "00. API Info & Versioning",
			"description": "API information and versioning endpoints (no auth required)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get API Info",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}", "host": ["{{api_base}}"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get All API Versions",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/versions", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["versions"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Current Version Info",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "X-API-Version", "value": "v1"}],
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/version", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["version"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Version Details (v1)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/versions/v1", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["versions", "v1"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Version Details (v2)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/versions/v2", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["versions", "v2"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Version Changelog",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/versions/v2/changelog", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["versions", "v2", "changelog"]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Migration Guide (v1 to v2)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/migration?from=v1&to=v2", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["migration"], "query": [{"key": "from", "value": "v1"}, {"key": "to", "value": "v2"}]}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "API Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {"raw": "{{api_base}}/health", "host": ["{{api_base}}"], "path": ["health"]}
					}
				}
			]
		},
